sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Workflow as GitHub Actions
  participant Make as Makefile
  participant Gate as coverage-gate
  participant Checker as Coverage checker

  Workflow->>Make: 执行 coverage 目标
  Make->>Gate: 传入 profile 与最低阈值
  Gate->>Gate: 解析参数并打开覆盖率文件
  Gate->>Checker: 请求计算总覆盖率
  Checker->>Checker: 按 Go package 累计语句
  Checker-->>Gate: 返回百分比与通过状态
  Gate->>Gate: 输出分包报告与 JSON
  Gate-->>Make: 返回 0 或 1
  Make-->>Workflow: 上传 coverage artifacts
